1
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:04,435
Every enterprise gets assets back.

2
00:00:04,435 --> 00:00:06,983
Each one is a decision worth money.

3
00:00:06,983 --> 00:00:14,480
Circularity is the agentic decision layer that makes it, and it plugs into the systems you already run.

4
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:18,581
Leaders start with a briefing, not a dashboard.

5
00:00:18,581 --> 00:00:28,950
Two point four million dollars recovered, one point seven million in new purchases avoided, and the value at risk right now, with its owner.

6
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,893
And it is plug and play.

7
00:00:34,893 --> 00:00:36,391
No rip and replace.

8
00:00:36,391 --> 00:00:39,939
Circularity connects to what you already run:

9
00:00:39,939 --> 00:00:45,696
lease, ERP, asset management, repair, warehouse, quality and market data.

10
00:00:45,696 --> 00:00:48,850
Those systems stay the system of record.

11
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:53,463
Agents keep those connections healthy.

12
00:00:53,463 --> 00:00:58,230
Here, one explains why the market feed is stale, and what fixes it.

13
00:01:04,670 --> 00:01:08,888
In Workflow Studio, describe an integration in plain words.

14
00:01:08,888 --> 00:01:12,963
The agent drafts the pipeline step by step and checks it.

15
00:01:12,963 --> 00:01:15,680
A person decides whether to accept it.

16
00:01:20,810 --> 00:01:22,241
Step one, evidence.

17
00:01:22,241 --> 00:01:30,600
Asset and Product Intelligence brings everything your systems know about one returned motor into a single view:

18
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:36,850
identity, lease, return and transit, condition, certification, and the cost inputs.

19
00:01:37,060 --> 00:01:44,360
Everything on this page is retrieved, never guessed, and every value traces back to the record it came from.

20
00:01:50,020 --> 00:01:53,221
The agents turn that evidence into a decision.

21
00:01:53,221 --> 00:01:56,422
Every input is frozen in an evidence snapshot:

22
00:01:56,422 --> 00:02:01,780
the source system, the exact record, the time it was fetched, and a checksum.

23
00:02:04,740 --> 00:02:06,238
Steps two and three.

24
00:02:06,238 --> 00:02:09,757
Seven possible next lives are built and priced.

25
00:02:09,757 --> 00:02:12,079
Six pass the eligibility gates.

26
00:02:12,079 --> 00:02:14,550
One is withheld, with the reason.

27
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:19,244
Redeploying it against the customer's replacement order wins.

28
00:02:19,244 --> 00:02:26,522
Ninety-six hundred dollars, forty-eight hundred ahead of selling, with a range and high confidence.

29
00:02:26,522 --> 00:02:28,580
And it explains exactly why.

30
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,235
Step four, stress it.

31
00:02:30,235 --> 00:02:35,290
If the confirmed demand is cancelled, the ranking changes in front of you.

32
00:02:35,290 --> 00:02:36,520
Nothing is hidden.

33
00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:39,489
Step five.

34
00:02:39,489 --> 00:02:40,987
The planner submits.

35
00:02:40,987 --> 00:02:42,111
Agents prepare.

36
00:02:42,111 --> 00:02:43,160
People commit.

37
00:02:52,410 --> 00:03:00,484
The approver sees the drafted rationale, their own approval limit, and the exact instruction, before anything leaves.

38
00:03:00,484 --> 00:03:03,590
Your systems stay authoritative for the work.

39
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:10,859
Behind the screen, every stage was run by Circularity's agents.

40
00:03:10,859 --> 00:03:17,400
The agent, the tool it called, the system it reached, and the audit record that proves it.

41
00:03:20,180 --> 00:03:24,563
Where models decide, they are named, with their measured error.

42
00:03:24,563 --> 00:03:30,060
Gradient-boosted pricing, and a vision model that checks the inspection photos.

43
00:03:31,530 --> 00:03:32,788
Steps six to nine.

44
00:03:32,788 --> 00:03:38,097
The approved plan goes into your order, maintenance and warehouse processes.

45
00:03:38,097 --> 00:03:42,010
Each system does the work, and sends its reference back.

46
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,282
Step ten.

47
00:03:46,282 --> 00:03:48,126
The outcome comes back.

48
00:03:48,126 --> 00:03:58,790
Ninety-six hundred predicted, ninety-two thirty actual, explained cost line by cost line, and every line names the model that learns.

49
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,294
Plug and play.

50
00:04:01,294 --> 00:04:02,198
Agent first.

51
00:04:02,198 --> 00:04:03,328
Human governed.

52
00:04:03,328 --> 00:04:05,286
Your systems run the work.

53
00:04:05,286 --> 00:04:08,600
Circularity makes sure it is the right work.
